  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(a3 + b3 + c3 - 3abc), where a = 335, b = 215 and c = 180.\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a3 + b3 + c3 - 3abc) = (a + b + c) × 1/2 × [(a-b)2 + (b-c)2 + (c-a)2 ]\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(a3 + b3 + c3 - 3abc) = (335 + 215 + 180) × 1/2 × (335-215)² + (215-180)² + (180-335)² \n\n⇒ 14472250\n\n** ∴ The correct option is 3**",
